      <Docs>
        <summary>Indicates that only notifications selected by the user will appear as bubbles.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Indicates that only notifications selected by the user will appear as bubbles. If the app sends bubbles that haven't been selected, only the notification appear. If the bubble has been approved by the user, it will appear along with the notification.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/NotificationManager#BUBBLE_PREFERENCE_SELECTED" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.NotificationManager.BUBBLE_PREFERENCE_SELECTED</code>.</a></format></para>
